<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post1483348465239050451..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Retail-Level Tyranny</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>18</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6196057766422290151</id><published>2014-10-29T09:11:24.686-06:00</published><updated>2014-10-29T09:11:24.686-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will, the link you posted above concerning the Pol...</title><content type='html'>Will, the link you posted above concerning the Police Foundation&amp;#39;s year-long crime study does not appear to be working. Just thought I&amp;#39;d point it out.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Great article btw.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/6196057766422290151'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/6196057766422290151'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html?showComment=1414595484686#c6196057766422290151' title=''/><author><name>Slim934</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/06284079001133846704</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1483348465239050451' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1483348465239050451' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-7889427"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 29, 2014 at 9:11 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-267638324481758235</id><published>2014-09-29T20:52:57.144-06:00</published><updated>2014-09-29T20:52:57.144-06:00</updated><title type='text'>This is easily the most interesting,  and certainl...</title><content type='html'>This is easily the most interesting,  and certainly the most frustratingly on - the - nose article about the emerging police state I&amp;#39;ve ever read. I can only hope more people find it as infuriating as I do. As for you, you have a new reader.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/267638324481758235'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/267638324481758235'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html?showComment=1412045577144#c267638324481758235' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1483348465239050451' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1483348465239050451' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1091274192"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 29, 2014 at 8:52 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5862088743187053488</id><published>2014-09-19T17:17:20.567-06:00</published><updated>2014-09-19T17:17:20.567-06:00</updated><title type='text'>After spending 500 dollars on various fruit trees ...</title><content type='html'>After spending 500 dollars on various fruit trees and bushes, and several days of grueling hard work planting them, somebody vandalized my property and tore out more then half of the 30 or so plants. I called the police in our mostly rural county. They arrived within the hour and the first words from their lips were, &amp;quot;what&amp;#39;s your date of birth and social security number?&amp;quot; They also didn&amp;#39;t seem very concerned and treated the whole thing as a waste of their time. Since it&amp;#39;s necessary to &amp;quot;dig a 100 dollar hole to plant a ten dollar tree,&amp;quot; I had suffered a huge loss. That was the first time I&amp;#39;d ever called the police to report a crime. It is certainly the last.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/5862088743187053488'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/5862088743187053488'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html?showComment=1411168640567#c5862088743187053488' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1483348465239050451' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1483348465239050451' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-76641701"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 19, 2014 at 5:17 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5030338168386452231</id><published>2014-07-26T16:35:57.008-06:00</published><updated>2014-07-26T16:35:57.008-06:00</updated><title type='text'>One evening my son and his girlfriend were driving...</title><content type='html'>One evening my son and his girlfriend were driving home and had to stop for a traffic light. They we hit from behind at full speed by a foreigner driving drunk. The driver and his SUV just backed up and went on the run. When police were notified they said there was nothing they could do. As the couple we en-route to the hospital for treatment of there injuries. My other son and I went looking for the driver. He was found passed out hidden by the underpass exit just blocks away from where the accident occurred. It was our effort that brought justice that day, not the police as they were more interested in their Doughnut Run than in helping the public that pay their salaries and whom they supposedly serve. I cannot remember how many times I used to assist officers in trouble. In that they now represent The System they are on their own.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/5030338168386452231'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/5030338168386452231'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html?showComment=1406414157008#c5030338168386452231' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1483348465239050451' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1483348465239050451' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-497387719"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 26, 2014 at 4:35 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4997121001020241825</id><published>2014-07-21T17:42:19.728-06:00</published><updated>2014-07-21T17:42:19.728-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Smart discerning citizens will access The Rutherfo...</title><content type='html'>Smart discerning citizens will access The Rutherford Institute&amp;#39;s website:&lt;br /&gt;https://www.rutherford.org/publications_resources/john_whiteheads_commentary/the_stealing_of_america_by_the_cops_the_courts_the_corporations_and_co&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Methinks that Mr. Rutherford and Mr. Grigg HAVE to be related.  I wish they both were in my family!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/4997121001020241825'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/4997121001020241825'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html?showComment=1405986139728#c4997121001020241825' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1483348465239050451' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1483348465239050451' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1944065610"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 21, 2014 at 5:42 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2598092830537996657</id><published>2014-07-20T19:12:04.609-06:00</published><updated>2014-07-20T19:12:04.609-06:00</updated><title type='text'>If I&amp;#39;m not mistaken, both George Wallace and R...</title><content type='html'>If I&amp;#39;m not mistaken, both George Wallace and Ralph Nader have been quoted as saying &amp;quot;There&amp;#39;s not a dime&amp;#39;s worth of difference between the Democratic and Republican parties.&amp;quot; &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;When we have that kind of consensus, is there really any doubt? &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Anyone who hasn&amp;#39;t been asleep like Rip van Winkles knows that both major US parties are puppets of the banksters who control the Federal Reserve System and other global financial entities. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/2598092830537996657'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/2598092830537996657'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html?showComment=1405905124609#c2598092830537996657' title=''/><author><name>Bevin Chu</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/03212261042382022326</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='26' height='32' src='http://bp0.blogger.com/_1HM_-KHZ5K4/RttJeQYaHnI/AAAAAAAABG4/eMDY9RoJATU/s400/mask_news.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1483348465239050451' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1483348465239050451' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1380945253"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 20, 2014 at 7:12 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2030897655668887902</id><published>2014-07-20T13:59:25.242-06:00</published><updated>2014-07-20T13:59:25.242-06:00</updated><title type='text'>It defies understanding that anybody could believe...</title><content type='html'>It defies understanding that anybody could believe that the GOP is any less inhospitable to individual liberty and dignity than the other branch of the corporatist party: &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-triumph-of-reich-publican-party.html&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/2030897655668887902'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/2030897655668887902'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html?showComment=1405886365242#c2030897655668887902' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-CdehOMAdGmU/U8b9GaqH43I/AAAAAAAAKnc/9NFpgc6WOsk/s220/NewProfile.png'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1483348465239050451' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1483348465239050451' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 20, 2014 at 1:59 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4299735977935037644</id><published>2014-07-20T10:48:10.907-06:00</published><updated>2014-07-20T10:48:10.907-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Just like to remind you that the House of Represen...</title><content type='html'>Just like to remind you that the House of Representatives is controlled by Republicans--the very folks who are always crying about freedom.  Looks to me like they have the freedom to profit from defense spending and we have the freedom to get tazed, shot, and choked.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/4299735977935037644'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/4299735977935037644'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html?showComment=1405874890907#c4299735977935037644' title=''/><author><name>sharonsj</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1483348465239050451' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1483348465239050451' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-863784804"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 20, 2014 at 10:48 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6663431552910919054</id><published>2014-07-19T17:57:36.324-06:00</published><updated>2014-07-19T17:57:36.324-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Please share and make the time to view Rob Hustle&amp;...</title><content type='html'>Please share and make the time to view Rob Hustle&amp;#39;s &amp;#39;Call The Cops&amp;#39; video on YouTube.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IlY9C6pzxKc  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;So so glad that younger people have a means to learn what&amp;#39;s happening to society via this video.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/6663431552910919054'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/6663431552910919054'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html?showComment=1405814256324#c6663431552910919054' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1483348465239050451' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1483348465239050451' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1944065610"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 19, 2014 at 5:57 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-373733552111602213</id><published>2014-07-19T17:17:58.353-06:00</published><updated>2014-07-19T17:17:58.353-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Hey William!&#xa;I&amp;#39;m a long time reader of yours a...</title><content type='html'>Hey William!&lt;br /&gt;I&amp;#39;m a long time reader of yours and I was wondering if you ever write for reason.com?  Some of their articles on police abuse are pretty good but nothing as detailed and succinct as your writings.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/373733552111602213'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/373733552111602213'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html?showComment=1405811878353#c373733552111602213' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1483348465239050451' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1483348465239050451' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-226768018"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 19, 2014 at 5:17 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2382242129000660242</id><published>2014-07-19T05:45:17.261-06:00</published><updated>2014-07-19T05:45:17.261-06:00</updated><title type='text'>The inner contradictions when a monopoly positivis...</title><content type='html'>The inner contradictions when a monopoly positivist legal system is enforcer, rather than the NAP.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;With the NAP, this case is simple; no legs broken, no pockets picked.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;now for the abuses of a positivistic monopoly: http://mic.com/articles/93295/why-are-police-officers-allegedly-trying-to-force-this-teen-to-get-an-erection </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/2382242129000660242'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/2382242129000660242'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html?showComment=1405770317261#c2382242129000660242' title=''/><author><name>Keith</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1483348465239050451' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1483348465239050451' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-903529874"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 19, 2014 at 5:45 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6669123782955186952</id><published>2014-07-19T03:09:32.305-06:00</published><updated>2014-07-19T03:09:32.305-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;When a disgusted citizen tells an abusive po...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;When a disgusted citizen tells an abusive police officer that he pays the officer&amp;#39;s salary, the victim is committing a category error. Those of us who constitute the productive sector don&amp;#39;t pay the police; they are paid by the people who plunder our property at gunpoint.&amp;quot; &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Truer words were never spoken. It&amp;#39;s amazing how We the Sheeple mentally blank out this ugly reality.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/6669123782955186952'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/6669123782955186952'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html?showComment=1405760972305#c6669123782955186952' title=''/><author><name>Bevin Chu</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/03212261042382022326</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='26' height='32' src='http://bp0.blogger.com/_1HM_-KHZ5K4/RttJeQYaHnI/AAAAAAAABG4/eMDY9RoJATU/s400/mask_news.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1483348465239050451' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1483348465239050451' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1380945253"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 19, 2014 at 3:09 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5454662447655270290</id><published>2014-07-19T01:17:34.993-06:00</published><updated>2014-07-19T01:17:34.993-06:00</updated><title type='text'>While you&amp;#39;re at it: the Constitution forbids t...</title><content type='html'>While you&amp;#39;re at it: the Constitution forbids the military from enforcing the law but there&amp;#39;s nothing about militarizing the police and use them to subjugate the population.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It&amp;#39;s interesting you noted that the modern police originated from Robert Peel is a reminder that like a singular currency and a standing military - the police force is a relatively modern invention.  For much of history the rulers didn&amp;#39;t issue currency and let the market decide.  For much of history there was no official military but the men formed militias in times of invasion.  And, of course, for much of history there was no standing police force so when crimes were committed it was expected the household had the right of self-defence but failing that the men would voluntarily band together into a militia to enforce the law.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/5454662447655270290'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/5454662447655270290'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html?showComment=1405754254993#c5454662447655270290' title=''/><author><name>Gil</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1483348465239050451' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1483348465239050451' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-298031390"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 19, 2014 at 1:17 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7637781194280038419</id><published>2014-07-18T19:46:51.881-06:00</published><updated>2014-07-18T19:46:51.881-06:00</updated><title type='text'>http://www.examiner.com/article/right-to-arms-isn-...</title><content type='html'>http://www.examiner.com/article/right-to-arms-isn-t-only-freedom-progressives-want-to-eviscerate&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Did you see this, grigg?  The awful congresswoman Maloney is trying to have Larry Pratt and the GOA investigated by the police because  of the recent Rolling Stone propaganda piece quoting Pratt as saying the 2nd amendment was meant to scare the govt and keep them in check from tyranny.  She is basically proving the point of Madison in federalist 46 and Hamilton in federalist 28, and those guys were moderates compared to Sam Adams and Jefferson and mason!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/7637781194280038419'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/7637781194280038419'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html?showComment=1405734411881#c7637781194280038419' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1483348465239050451' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1483348465239050451' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-589723300"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 18, 2014 at 7:46 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6686702368192078926</id><published>2014-07-18T18:13:32.991-06:00</published><updated>2014-07-18T18:13:32.991-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Great info about the cowardly nypd cop. Not a surp...</title><content type='html'>Great info about the cowardly nypd cop. Not a surprise that the New York daily news praised him with as anti gun as they are for the avg person.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/6686702368192078926'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/6686702368192078926'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html?showComment=1405728812991#c6686702368192078926' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1483348465239050451' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1483348465239050451' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-589723300"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 18, 2014 at 6:13 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3573531189658472679</id><published>2014-07-18T14:58:31.590-06:00</published><updated>2014-07-18T14:58:31.590-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Anonymous,&#xa;Don&amp;#39;t ever try to sell that bike. I...</title><content type='html'>Anonymous,&lt;br /&gt;Don&amp;#39;t ever try to sell that bike. If you do, it will pop up in their computer, and in the middle of the night a SWAT team will smash down your door and shoot you and everyone else in your house to death, unarmed or not - For trying to sell your own bike. Of course your death will be ruled a proper use of force and according to proper procedure. But it&amp;#39;s better than being sent to jail, where you might be boiled to death or asphyxiated with a plastic bag filled with pepper spray tied over your head, not as nice ways to die as a bullet. So be grateful to the cops for their services to you.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.policestateusa.com/&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; - LG</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/3573531189658472679'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/3573531189658472679'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html?showComment=1405717111590#c3573531189658472679' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1483348465239050451' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1483348465239050451' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-140406185"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 18, 2014 at 2:58 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8114609392726623065</id><published>2014-07-18T12:36:11.845-06:00</published><updated>2014-07-18T12:36:11.845-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Personal story about police being useless up to a ...</title><content type='html'>Personal story about police being useless up to a point.  I had a bicycle stolen from me, and I reported it to the police along with the serial number.  A year and a half later, someone took it to a pawn shop where it was discovered to be stolen.  The police went and got it and talked to the person who pawned it.  Of course, the guy who pawned my bike said he bought it from someone else but refused to say who he got it from--which in my book is called protecting a criminal.  What do you think the police did with this guy?  They let him go without charges.  &lt;br /&gt;At least I got my bike back.  The criminal is still out there, probably stealing more bikes now that he knows he can get away with it, even after he&amp;#39;s been caught!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/8114609392726623065'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/8114609392726623065'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html?showComment=1405708571845#c8114609392726623065' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1483348465239050451' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1483348465239050451' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-636485934"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 18, 2014 at 12:36 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3561541181074693849</id><published>2014-07-18T06:32:01.330-06:00</published><updated>2014-07-18T06:32:01.330-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;Police are properly seen as retail-level dis...</title><content type='html'> &amp;quot;Police are properly seen as retail-level distributors of violence on behalf of the coercion cartel.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;an excellent use of the language, Will. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;the occupation forces are here.  the willingly deaf, dumb and blind allow what is among us.  it has and will continue to turn on us, increasing as each day passes.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;will a critical point ever be reached?  or will we become just another third world hellhole? </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/3561541181074693849'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483348465239050451/comments/default/3561541181074693849'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html?showComment=1405686721330#c3561541181074693849' title=''/><author><name>kirk</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/07/retail-level-tyranny.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1483348465239050451' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1483348465239050451' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-892609118"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 18, 2014 at 6:32 AM"/></entry></feed>